# ── Soloist environment contract (validated by src/env.ts) ──
# Story 1.1 is path-based on a single domain (soloist.cjjutba.com) and needs
# NO environment variables. Later stories add them here as they need them:
#   DATABASE_URL                       → Story 1.2 (Neon + Drizzle)
#   BETTER_AUTH_SECRET                 → Story 1.3 (auth)
#   GITHUB_APP_* / RESEND_API_KEY /
#   INNGEST_* / BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN  → later epics
